{"id":"4947","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4947_main_lightning-ground-discharge_electrometeors.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>来自积雨云的闪电<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">地面放电</span>（云对地闪电）袭击了香港（中国）山顶的高地。</p>\n<p>一道低压槽为广东沿海地区带来雷阵雨。按照惯例，当闪电发生时，云被归类为积雨云。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Irene Ho","location":"中国香港山顶","latitude":"纬度: 22° 16' 33'' N","longitude":"经度: 114° 8' 30'' E","date":"31 March 2014 1945 (当地时间)","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: S.14.1.1.1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.14.1.1.1"},{"src":"/images/compressed/syn/4947_syn_lightning-ground-discharge_electrometeors.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>一道低压槽给中国广东沿海地区带来雷阵雨。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 香港特别行政区政府","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/upper/4947_upper_lightning-ground-discharge_electrometeors.png","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"></div>","copyright":"© 香港特别行政区政府","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5073_main_lightning-ground-discharge_electrometeors.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>这张照片显示了美国爱荷华州一场相当高层的晚间雷暴期间的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">云对地闪电放电</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Matthew Clark","location":"美利坚合众国爱荷华州大草原","latitude":"纬度: 40° 45' 9'' N","longitude":"经度: 95° 33' 53'' W","date":"31 May 2009 2200 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: P.14.0","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.14.0"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5074_main_anvil-crawler-lightning_electrometeors.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>这张照片显示的是美国内布拉斯加州林肯市一道强烈的中级雷暴砧状云的闪电分支。 这些云放电通俗地称为<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">“砧状履带”</span>。</p>\n<p>在图像的右侧可以看到无雨<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">上升气流</span>底部。在其他地方，云层细节被强降水掩盖。在无雨上升气流底部附近，<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">降水井</span>明显。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Matthew Clark","location":"美国内布拉斯加州林肯","latitude":"纬度: 40° 48' 49'' N","longitude":"经度: 96° 38' 4'' W","date":"01 June 2009 0015 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西南","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: P.14.1.1.2.1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.14.1.1.2.1"},{"src":"/images/compressed/4997_main_thunderstorm_clouds-electrometeors.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc6\"><p>南中国海北部的热带低气压加剧为名为“银河”的热带风暴。香港（中国）这一天的天气炎热，阳光充足，还有几阵狂风骤雨和雷暴。</p>\n<p>雷暴与积雨云有关，并且通常伴有降水。这张照片显示了晚上从<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">秃积雨云</span>中产生的雷暴。雷暴被定义为一次或多次突然放电，表现为闪光<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">（闪电）</span>和刺耳的声音或隆隆声（雷声）。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Sung Lok Cheung","location":"中国香港元朗","latitude":"纬度: 22° 28' 33'' N","longitude":"经度: 114° 1' 20'' E","date":"26 July 2016 1934 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东南","cloudCode":"CL= 3, CM= 0, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: P.14.1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.14.1"}]}]}